Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.32,0:00:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Greyrat-san{*Mr. Greyrat}!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.57,0:00:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good. I was just about to try your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.33,0:00:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Letter for you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.71,0:00:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who's it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from Paul!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rudeus, congratulations on getting into the University of Magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know we've had our differences, \Nbut I'm glad you're walking your own path.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.52,0:00:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Elinalise probably told you, \Nbut we've got a solid lead on Zenith.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.48,0:00:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Give her my best, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.03,0:00:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're in East Port now, about to cross over to the Begaritt Continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.41,0:00:58.20,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,{\i1}Begaritt is one of the most dangerous places in\N the world, second only to the Demon Continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:01:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't feel right bringing kids there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.08,0:01:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So we talked about sending Aisha and Norn to join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.17,0:01:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course, we can't risk making the kids travel on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.30,0:01:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I decided that I'd rather keep them close than have to worry about them all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.10,0:01:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But then we bumped into a familiar face.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.85,0:01:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's someone that you know.{For the anime having Paul gender the guardian doesn't cause problems, but it makes it more different from the novel than it needs to be.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.98,0:01:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They offered to escort the kids, \Nand I took them up on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.52,0:01:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I bet you'll be surprised when you see them.{tlc: when they arrive}{I understood the original line to mean this.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.11,0:01:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aisha's resourceful, like you, and has a good head on her shoulders too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.61,0:01:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Norn's a little different from the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.91,0:01:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She doesn't like you, and she doesn't get along too well with Aisha, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.66,0:01:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As her brother, I hope you'll bear with it and look after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.67,0:01:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Anyway, you get the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.92,0:01:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I feel awful about dumping all this on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.63,0:01:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thanks in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.09,0:01:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yours truly, Paul Greyrat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.89,0:02:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He never stops apologizing, \Nbut I can tell he trusts me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've gotta live up to that. \NI mean, I am the eldest son!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Still, I wonder who volunteered for bodyguard duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.28,0:02:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sylphie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.79,0:03:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened, Rudy? I don't\N see you this excited often.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a letter from my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.63,0:03:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! From Paul{*}-san{*}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:04:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup. It sounds like everyone's doing okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.43,0:04:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.68,0:04:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.81,0:04:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know this is sudden, \Nbut my two little sisters are coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.27,0:04:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to put them up in our house. Would you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.61,0:04:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.23,0:04:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be lively around here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.11,0:04:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.15,0:04:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Me getting married and setting up house might work out well for my family, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.45,0:04:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Paul could even bring everyone to settle down with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.37,0:04:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But man, an ex-NEET supporting his folks?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.63,0:04:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It really makes you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.75,0:04:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for this meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.68,0:04:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ah, bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.18,0:04:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't believe I have a place to call home and get to eat with my honey every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.81,0:04:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I owe Sylphie a thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.98,0:04:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sylphie, is there anything you want me to do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.57,0:04:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.73,0:04:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.53,0:05:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. Teach me that that spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.11,0:05:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The one you used on me during your entrance exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Disturb Magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.37,0:05:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing could be simpler. \NI'll give you the full hands-on course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.54,0:05:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,In exchange, I'll teach you healing magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.71,0:05:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I know up to Advanced spells, for what it's worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Great. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.17,0:05:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And so, we ended up teaching each other magic after dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Er, I don't {\i1}think{\i0} incantation-less healing works differently from other spells.{reminder that I don't care if this particular term is inconsistent}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.69,0:05:35.94,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,Could it be that you don't feel anything from the person you're healing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:43.28,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's right. I don't feel any feedback when I'm healing someone, myself included.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.28,0:05:47.08,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,{\i1}For attack spells, I can feel my mana as if it's flowing through my veins, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.00,0:05:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel kind of relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.29,0:05:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even you can't do {\i1}everything{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.13,0:05:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to admit it, but I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.05,0:06:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Now it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.22,0:06:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Sylphie...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.85,0:06:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What? I'm trying to focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.94,0:06:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think our kids will have a knack for magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.78,0:06:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well, we won't know until we have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.28,0:06:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,True enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I take after the elf side of my family,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.46,0:06:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,so I might have trouble conceiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.17,0:06:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If, um, I can't manage to have kids, \Nyou could always get a concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.47,0:06:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do no such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.14,0:06:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What I want isn't children. It's the fruit of love with someone I cherish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.35,0:06:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, Sylphie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.19,0:06:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup. I love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.07,0:07:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If this circle succeeds, \Nwe can proceed to the next phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.03,0:07:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nanahoshi's spent the past month just drawing this tour de force.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.07,0:07:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For her, it's the culmination of two years' work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.62,0:07:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So, would you mind telling me what this circle does?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.12,0:07:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It summons an object from another world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.83,0:07:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't cause another mass teleportation, will it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.38,0:07:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's safe. In theory, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.38,0:07:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I hear this theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.18,0:07:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Our experiments thus far have shown
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.77,0:07:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,that summoning larger and more complex objects requires greater mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.35,0:07:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning the law of conservation of energy applies to this world's magical...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.15,0:07:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Basically, mana explains most weird things about this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.83,0:07:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.12,0:07:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, when I make rocks in midair with earth magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.66,0:07:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm converting the nearby mana into stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.62,0:08:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, end of explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.84,0:08:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.50,0:08:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.51,0:08:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Something seems off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.43,0:08:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Like there's a hitch in the way the circle lights up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.45,0:08:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did it short-circuit?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Either way, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.45,0:08:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.81,0:08:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.35,0:09:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go home for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.02,0:09:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well, these things happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.69,0:09:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.78,0:09:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nanahoshi's been awfully tense lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.46,0:09:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This failure must be hitting her pretty hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.33,0:09:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No. Nanahoshi's a lot tougher than she looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.09,0:09:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I bet she's big enough to take a failure for what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.28,0:09:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:52.40,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Hey, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go home! I can't go home! I can't go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.95,0:09:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.83,0:10:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.88,0:10:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been working yourself a little too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the rest of the day off. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.64,0:10:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.51,0:10:17.56,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.56,0:10:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.85,0:10:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.98,0:10:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Zanoba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.23,0:10:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever is the matter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.15,0:10:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanahoshi's in trouble. Help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.69,0:10:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.28,0:10:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,More or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.32,0:10:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's carry her to the infirmary to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.11,0:10:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.57,0:10:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Gently, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.66,0:10:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.74,0:10:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Come along, {*}Silent-dono{*Ms. Silent}.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.01,0:10:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.63,0:10:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So, she hasn't been conducting her research for the pleasure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.01,0:10:59.26,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.98,0:11:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Master looks awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.23,0:11:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm an ugly piece of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.15,0:11:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll talk with Sylphie about looking after Nanahoshi at our place for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.53,0:11:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't risk leaving her alone in this state.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.08,0:11:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That seems like the best course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.08,0:11:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Zanoba, would you help me carry her home?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gladly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.22,0:11:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Master, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Zanoba treating you all right, Julie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.23,0:11:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Master gives lots to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.57,0:11:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.53,0:11:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Master gives you a lot to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.70,0:12:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Master gives me a lot to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.74,0:12:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.25,0:12:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder if Nanahoshi's been eating right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.29,0:12:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Having meals with friends can do wonders for anxiety all on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:19.47,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,{\i1}Has she been getting that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.14,0:12:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're both Japanese and share a secret, \Nbut I know almost nothing about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.15,0:12:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She's still sleeping. She must have been exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.66,0:12:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I cast a healing spell on her, just to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.45,0:12:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Sorry to bother you during guard duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.71,0:12:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. When I changed her clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.92,0:12:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It might just be for work, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.63,0:13:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold on to it, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.43,0:13:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is {*}Silent-dono{*Ms. Silent} well?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.98,0:13:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I owe you one, Zanoba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.27,0:13:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Master, you always do so much for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But do {\i1}you{\i0} feel well?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.03,0:13:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.32,0:13:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Your face is as pale as {*}Silent-dono{*Ms. Silent}'s.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.20,0:13:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I just... relived some bad memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.08,0:13:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lost heart and closed myself off like that, too. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.59,0:13:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say I know the feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I {\i0}do{\i1} know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.47,0:13:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If things had been a little different, \NI could've ended up like that instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.35,0:13:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, please call on me if you need any further assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.86,0:14:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I have strength to spare, if nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.32,0:14:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I will. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.49,0:14:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.70,0:14:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want anything to eat, I'll ask Sylphie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. How about potato chips?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.59,0:14:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You seemed to like those, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.55,0:14:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll heat up a bath, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.17,0:14:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They do say a wash does your mind good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.68,0:14:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me if anything comes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.35,0:14:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd plugged every hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.48,0:14:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic circles are like circuit boards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.40,0:14:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You put multiple circuit patterns together to create one function.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.53,0:14:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But no matter what I did, \Nthat one point wouldn't connect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.00,0:14:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's physically impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.12,0:14:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning I can never go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.64,0:15:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like you to take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.68,0:15:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A magic circle?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.18,0:15:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it for, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.18,0:15:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a summoning circle that Silent was researching.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.94,0:15:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She got a bit stuck, \Nso I'd like to pick your brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.28,0:15:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Master, none of us specializes in summoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.70,0:15:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's no big deal if you can't fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.45,0:15:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But, coming from different fields, \Nyou might come up with different ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.54,0:15:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,For starters, look at this bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.87,0:15:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The mana seems to cut off here. Can you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.88,0:15:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It cuts out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.92,0:15:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And, er, this part connects to... here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.42,0:15:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you think of any way to run mana through here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.85,0:15:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two parts go like this, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.64,0:15:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If we redraw it from scratch... No, but then...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.27,0:16:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.86,0:16:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't a compound design work?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.23,0:16:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "compound"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.36,0:16:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The doll I'm studying stacks multiple layers of magical circles to create one effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.62,0:16:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, I've only just begun work on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.33,0:16:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and I've never drawn a magic circle in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.75,0:16:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on. When you say "doll," \Ndo you mean that one from the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.59,0:16:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take a look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.06,0:16:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever built this was a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.44,0:16:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a circle like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.10,0:16:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't figure out how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.02,0:16:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it just two circles overlaid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.78,0:16:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No, there are more layers than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It needs all of them together to function properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.62,0:16:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But it moved even when it was broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.12,0:16:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What {\i1}is{\i0} this magic circle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.58,0:16:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know much yet myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.25,0:17:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but according to the book, \Nthis circle controls the elbow joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.80,0:17:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There, there. A genius like you will figure it out in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.51,0:17:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.18,0:17:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cliff{*}-senpai{*}, if we use the techniques from this doll,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,do you think we can fix the problem with Silent's circle?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.93,0:17:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but it seems possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.61,0:17:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Show her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.85,0:17:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This... might work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.39,0:18:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.02,0:18:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I never needed to stick to two dimensions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.44,0:18:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course. Even drawn on paper, they still have depth!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.27,0:18:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If I layer them, I can make as big a circle as I need!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.90,0:18:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I think of something so simple?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.62,0:18:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! That's not right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.00,0:18:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, shouldn't it go like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.17,0:18:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.54,0:18:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretty smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.30,0:18:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. I {\i1}am{\i0} a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.59,0:18:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do with this part, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.34,0:18:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on a sec. You... could use this formula here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.43,0:18:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, then this part should work like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.60,0:18:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Unconventional, but it seems feasible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.92,0:19:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. I'll activate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.65,0:19:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is quite something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.78,0:19:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Glass?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.03,0:19:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's too soft for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.12,0:19:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's just a plastic bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.62,0:19:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.75,0:19:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.21,0:19:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But it {\i0}is{\i1} a plastic bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.17,0:19:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd call that a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.05,0:19:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can finally advance to the next phase!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.13,0:19:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Layered magic circles!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.22,0:20:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If keep developing these, \NI can probably summon anything I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.23,0:20:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I guess I put you through a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.89,0:20:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,"Give and take," remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.90,0:20:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So, lend a hand the next time I'm in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.15,0:20:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Of course I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.11,0:20:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's celebrate like there's no tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.32,0:20:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your treat, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.32,0:20:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.87,0:20:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But after that, we're even.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.37,0:20:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.81,0:20:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.23,0:20:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.65,0:21:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't like this kind of get-together, \Nso I never went to one in my past life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.28,0:21:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But when life gets you down and people around you help out,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.79,0:21:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}you can't help cheering up and wanting to party to spread the joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.38,0:21:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You can't live if you don't forget everything once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.96,0:21:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Life's too full of downs for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.02,0:21:27.06,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.98,0:22:54.02,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Post-Credits}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.02,0:23:36.06,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.15,0:23:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone home? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.11,0:23:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! {*}Onii-chan{*Big Brother}!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.95,0:23:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't have gotten here so late if you hadn't gotten lost, Norn!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.78,0:23:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You sounded sure it was the right way, too, Aisha!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.17,0:23:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Onii-chan{*Big Brother}!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.67,0:23:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Onii-chan{*Big Brother}! I've missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.17,0:23:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Rudeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.14,0:23:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.39,0:23:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! It's so good to see you again,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.89,0:23:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruijerd{*}-san{*}!
