Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.02,0:21:31.52,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Early in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.52,0:21:36.07,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}As we took that narrow shortcut to the highway
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.07,0:21:42.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}You saw me off saying "You have nothing to be afraid of,"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.99,0:21:47.95,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}And I shed a tear
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.75,0:21:54.42,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Never tiring of those same boring topics,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.42,0:21:59.01,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}We would laugh together in that messy room
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.01,0:22:03.55,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}I saw nothing to fear in following my dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.55,0:22:08.22,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}And bid farewell to the town where I was born
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.22,0:22:12.73,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}"I promise to come see you."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.73,0:22:17.32,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}"I promise I won't forget you."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.32,0:22:21.86,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Seeing your eyes as you waved,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.86,0:22:26.41,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}I couldn't open my mouth and swore them silently instead
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.41,0:22:30.91,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}In the skies of departure
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.91,0:22:35.58,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}I draw our meeting, parting, and all of our youth
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.58,0:22:42.34,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}One day, when the flowers we're raising bloom large and beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.34,0:22:47.85,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Let's laugh together again
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.02,0:21:31.52,ED,,0,0,0,,Early in the morning,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.52,0:21:36.07,ED,,0,0,0,,As we took that narrow shortcut to the highway
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.07,0:21:42.99,ED,,0,0,0,,You saw me off saying "You have nothing to be afraid of,"
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.99,0:21:47.95,ED,,0,0,0,,And I shed a tear
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.75,0:21:54.42,ED,,0,0,0,,Never tiring of those same boring topics,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.42,0:21:59.01,ED,,0,0,0,,We would laugh together in that messy room
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.01,0:22:03.55,ED,,0,0,0,,I saw nothing to fear in following my dreams
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.55,0:22:08.22,ED,,0,0,0,,And bid farewell to the town where I was born
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.22,0:22:12.73,ED,,0,0,0,,"I promise to come see you."
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.73,0:22:17.32,ED,,0,0,0,,"I promise I won't forget you."
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.32,0:22:21.86,ED,,0,0,0,,Seeing your eyes as you waved,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.86,0:22:26.41,ED,,0,0,0,,I couldn't open my mouth and swore them silently instead
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.41,0:22:30.91,ED,,0,0,0,,In the skies of departure
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.91,0:22:35.58,ED,,0,0,0,,I draw our meeting, parting, and all of our youth
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.58,0:22:42.34,ED,,0,0,0,,One day, when the flowers we're raising bloom large and beautiful,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.34,0:22:47.85,ED,,0,0,0,,Let's laugh together again
